Comment: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:20.62,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Hate is the opposite of love
Comment: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:24.57,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}But then what is love the opposite of?
Comment: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:27.97,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}My train of thought is already coming to a halt
Comment: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:31.26,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Well whatever, not like I'm going out anyway
Comment: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:35.73,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Even when nothing seems to be happening
Comment: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:39.10,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Suddenly radio waves start flying about
Comment: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:39.56,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Beep beep beep
Comment: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:44.67,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}No way, could this be the spark of love?
Comment: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:45.61,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Wha!?
Comment: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:46.89,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Dance with me
Comment: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:50.14,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Instead of worrying away or suddenly falling ill,
Comment: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:54.05,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}You should just dance the night away (within reason)
Comment: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:57.60,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}So take my hand and step to the beat
Comment: 0,0:00:57.79,0:01:00.25,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}If we laugh together we win!
Comment: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:01.66,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Dance with me
Comment: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:04.92,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Just for a bit, let's overcome
Comment: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:08.68,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Our forbidden love, with multiplication
Comment: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:12.25,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}And then even times that should be boring
Comment: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:15.70,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Will turn into happy, happy moments
