Comment: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:34.50,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}You say hate is the opposite of love
Comment: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:38.38,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}But if we're not careful, there's tons of pitfalls to fall into
Comment: 0,0:01:38.85,0:01:41.86,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Once you get the fever it's already too late
Comment: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:45.18,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}You'll forget to even eat and sleep
Comment: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:48.90,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Times that are all too fun
Comment: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:53.02,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Will pass way too fast, like in 2x speed
Comment: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:53.41,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}(sonic speed)
Comment: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:58.60,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}If you check your agenda you'll notice you forgot all your plans
Comment: 0,0:01:58.97,0:01:59.61,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Ah!
Comment: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:00.70,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}You guessed it
Comment: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:04.08,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Take all your failures or things that make you sad
Comment: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:07.89,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Throw them out and dance away (within reason)
Comment: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:11.48,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Every time you feel my heart beating hard
Comment: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:14.22,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}It means you're harboring love
Comment: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:15.56,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Dance with me
Comment: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:18.84,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Just for a bit, it's fine if it's unexpected
Comment: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:22.68,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Switch your timid self to attack mode
Comment: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:26.19,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Let's take this world with nothing interesting to do
Comment: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:29.54,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}And turn it into a happy, happy place
Comment: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:31.66,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Aah{\fn小塚ゴシック Pro H}~{\fnMilocha}
